--TEST--
`float` results render exactly as PHP renders them, trailing `.0` included — or rather excluded
--FILE--
<?mwl
echo 7.0 / 2.0, "|\n";
echo 1.5 + 2.25, "|\n";
echo 2.5 * 4.0, "|\n";
